> - **Reference correction:** The local PDPL reference misstates Regulation 17(1)(f): the retrieved Arabic text concerns disclosure without prior **controller approval**, with notice to the controller—not an exemption from data-subject consent. Regulation 17(2) addresses notification of unlawful controller instructions. The drafting below follows the retrieved text. [SDAIA regulation, Article 17](https://dgp.sdaia.gov.sa/wps/portal/pdp/knowledgecenter/details/PDPL2/) `[authority — SDAIA]`
