No notice addresses, electronic delivery arrangements, or signatory details follow.

**Gap:** Missing mechanics. **Legal risk 🟡; business friction 🟡.**

A renewal or breach notice can fail operationally even when the substantive right is clear. Arts. 175–177 permit agreed notice methods. Electronic Transactions Law Arts. 4–7 and 12–14 support electronic contracting and records subject to their conditions; a platform name alone does not establish certified-signature presumptions. [Electronic Transactions reference](</Users/basimkhoja/Projects/Legal Consultant/references/jurisdictions/ksa/electronic-transactions-law.md:32>) `[settled — last confirmed 2026-09-04]`; platform-specific status `[model knowledge — verify]`.

